---
import BaseHead from '../components/BaseHead.astro';
import Header from '../components/Header.astro';
import Footer from '../components/Footer.astro';
import PostList from '../components/PostList.astro';
import { SITE_DESCRIPTION, SITE_TITLE } from '../consts';
---
<!doctype html>
<html lang="ko">
  <head><BaseHead title={SITE_TITLE} description={SITE_DESCRIPTION} /></head>
  <body>
    <Header />
    <main id="main">
      <section class="intro entry">
        <h1>AI 도구를 만들고<br />실험합니다</h1>
        <p>AI를 쓰면서 당연하다고 여겼던 것들을<br class="desktop-break" /> 직접 실험해서 확인하고 있습니다.</p>
        <a class="text-link" href="/about">송승재 소개</a>
      </section>
      <section class="series-feature entry entry-later" aria-labelledby="series-title">
        <a class="cover" href="/blog/one-concept-llm-engineering-1/" aria-label="빈칸으로 이해하는 LLM 엔지니어링 1화 읽기"><img src="/images/series/seasons.webp" alt="여름의 찬 음료와 겨울의 따뜻한 음료를 나란히 그린 삽화" width="1440" height="960" fetchpriority="high" /></a>
        <div class="feature-copy"><p class="meta">LLM 엔지니어링 · 4부작</p><h2 id="series-title">빈칸으로 이해하는<br />LLM 엔지니어링</h2><p>지시를 쓰고 자료를 고르며 결과를 확인하기까지, 직접 해 본 실험을 네 편에 담았습니다.</p><a class="text-link" href="/blog/one-concept-llm-engineering-1/">1화부터 읽기</a></div>
      </section>
      <section class="all-posts" aria-labelledby="posts-title"><h2 id="posts-title">시리즈의 글</h2><PostList /></section>
    </main>
    <Footer />
  </body>
</html>
<style>
  .intro { max-width: 780px; margin-bottom: 60px; }
  .intro h1 { font-size: clamp(36px, 4.2vw, 54px); line-height: 1.25; letter-spacing: -.055em; margin-bottom: 24px; }
  .intro p { font-size: 17px; color: var(--muted); margin-bottom: 12px; line-height: 1.8; }
  .series-feature { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1.15fr 1fr; background: var(--surface); border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; }
  .cover { display: block; overflow: hidden; }
  .cover img { height: 100%; width: 100%; object-fit: cover; }
  .feature-copy { padding: 38px 40px; align-self: center; }
  .feature-copy .meta { margin-bottom: 16px; }
  .feature-copy h2 { font-size: 30px; line-height: 1.4; margin-bottom: 18px; }
  .feature-copy > p:not(.meta) { color: var(--muted); font-size: 15px; margin-bottom: 14px; max-width: 350px; }
  .all-posts { margin: 76px 0 0; }
  .all-posts > h2 { font-size: 19px; margin-bottom: 24px; }
  @media(max-width:767px) { .intro { margin-bottom: 40px; } .intro h1 { font-size: 36px; } .intro p { font-size: 16px; } .desktop-break { display: none; } .series-feature { grid-template-columns: 1fr; } .cover img { aspect-ratio: 3/2; } .feature-copy { padding: 28px; } .feature-copy h2 { font-size: 27px; } .all-posts { margin-top: 48px; } }
</style>
